HED version="1.1.0" library="testaux" withStandard="8.5.0" unmerged="True"

'''Prologue'''
testaux 1.1.0 is the deprecation version of the testaux auxiliary-items library of the hed-tests test schema set, partnered with standard schema 8.5.0 like 1.0.0. It is a copy of testaux 1.0.0 with three changes: the unit bigauxunit and the unit modifier auxMod carry deprecatedFrom=1.0.0, and the new unit auxsiunit, which has SIUnit, gives auxMod a unit to modify. It exists so the suite can test ELEMENT_DEPRECATED for a deprecated unit and a deprecated unit modifier, which no released standard schema can. Change from testaux 1.0.0: minor (elements deprecated, a unit added).

!# start schema

'''Aux-measure''' <nowiki>[A tag that takes a value with units of the auxUnits unit class.]</nowiki>
* <nowiki># {takesValue, unitClass=auxUnits}[Value of Aux-measure.]</nowiki>

'''Aux-value''' <nowiki>[A tag that takes a value of the auxClass value class.]</nowiki>
* <nowiki># {takesValue, valueClass=auxClass}[Value of Aux-value.]</nowiki>

!# end schema

'''Unit classes'''
* auxUnits <nowiki>{defaultUnits=auxunit}[The auxiliary unit class shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>
** auxunit <nowiki>{conversionFactor=1.0}[The base unit of the auxUnits unit class.]</nowiki>
** bigauxunit <nowiki>{conversionFactor=1000.0, deprecatedFrom=1.0.0}[A larger unit of the auxUnits unit class. Deprecated: use auxunit with a value 1000 times larger.]</nowiki>
** auxsiunit <nowiki>{SIUnit, conversionFactor=1.0}[An SI unit of the auxUnits unit class that takes SI unit modifiers.]</nowiki>

'''Unit modifiers'''
* auxMod <nowiki>{SIUnitModifier, conversionFactor=100.0, deprecatedFrom=1.0.0}[The auxiliary unit modifier shared across libraries in the aux merge cases. Deprecated: write the value 100 times larger without the modifier.]</nowiki>

'''Value classes'''
* auxClass <nowiki>{allowedCharacter=letters}[The auxiliary value class shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>

'''Schema attributes'''
* auxAttribute <nowiki>{boolRange}[The auxiliary schema attribute shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>

'''Properties'''

